# ==================================================
# Machine Learning
# ==================================================
# NOTE: "models/" (bare, no leading slash) was here and is intentionally
# removed - gitignore matches a bare directory name ANYWHERE in the
# tree, which was silently matching this Node.js app's own src/models/
# (Mongoose schemas) and tests/integration/models/ - neither of which
# is an ML artifact. This project has no ML checkpoints to ignore; if
# one is ever added, scope it explicitly (e.g. "/checkpoints/models/")
# rather than reintroducing a bare "models/" that matches anywhere.
checkpoints/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.h5
*.keras
*.joblib
*.pkl

# Uncomment these if you don't want to store datasets
# datasets/
# data/
# *.csv
# *.json

# ==================================================
# Jupyter
# ==================================================
*.ipynb_checkpoints

